Package: ymd-qt
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Pavel Bolkhovitin <pbolkhovitin@yandex.ru>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIBS@,
 ymd (>= 0.2.0),
 qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami,
 qml6-module-qtquick-controls,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
 qml6-module-qtquick-templates,
 qml6-module-qtquick-window,
 qml6-module-qtqml,
 qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
Recommends: plasma-workspace
Description: Standalone Qt/Kirigami client for the ymd daemon
 Yandex Music desktop application built with Qt Quick and Kirigami.
 It is a thin client: the ymd daemon owns authentication, the Yandex
 Music API, playback and MPRIS; the app talks to it over local HTTP.
